<metadata><name>Snowlands 1211 Crabtree Road to Burst Rock Junction</name><desc>out and back to waypoint 17; side trip from waypoint 12 to 17. 7.5 miles one-way to Burst Rock Junction or 15.0 miles round trip. Line traced from Marcus Libkind's map, tours.snowlands.org/tours/12/1211_tour.htm</desc></metadata>
